### 1. 学生登录
POST http://localhost:8080/student/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 心理咨询系统 - 咨询师登录（可切换 role：visitor/assistant/counselor）
POST http://localhost:8080/counsel/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "counselor",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "counselor"
}

### 3. 管理员登录
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}